{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"The nameless enters the stage, a stage kept dark as per his request. He puts a single candle in front of him, it mysteriously lights up all by itself.\nThe nameless then begins to tell the story of a lone traveler walking throughout the world. The traveler visited countless places and met countless of other people.\nThe story then turns a note of sadness and horror as the nameless begins to tell how the traveler met his end. The traveler was tricked by a charming nymph. The nymph said they'd bring the traveler to some treasure but was instead brought to the nymph's lair and was dismembered as a sacrifice to the maniacal deities the nymphs worship.\nThe nameless does not end the story there however. He proceeds to tell that while the traveler ended not so nicely, his journey and travels were still magnificent. We would be better off being happy for what the traveler did than be sad at what happened to them.\nAs the nameless finishes his story, the candlelight suddenly goes off.","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:32:26.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867957300000866325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
