{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Grimlock gets on stage and starts to growl and roar. You'd think you wouldn't understand it, but somehow you can.\n\nShe begins to paint the picture about the mighty dinosaur Grimlock travelled from the Old World across an entire ocean. She tells the story of how she fought a kraken and hugged a yeti and how she saved the entire Roanoke colony years ago. She'd tell you about what happened to the townspeople after that but then the story would get really long.\n\nIn the end, all that matters is that Grimlock received many cuddles. It is a very happy ending.","created_at":"2021-07-23T02:41:19.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867959536605089802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
